1138	     * immediate right child (it has no left child of its own), so
1139	     * rb_inorder_successor returns it directly and successor->parent ==
1140	     * target -- rb_delete must skip the detach-from-its-own-spot step and
1141	     * just move the successor into target's slot along with target's left
1142	     * subtree. */
1143	    {
