1321	 * RED sibling ("t"): Case 1 rotates left about "m" (t<->BLACK, m<->RED),
1322	 * then the new sibling "p" (BLACK, both children nil) hits Case 2, which
1323	 * recolors "p" RED and climbs fixNode to "m" -- now RED, so the loop exits
1324	 * and the trailing `fixNode->color = RB_BLACK` recolors "m" back to BLACK. */
