1414	 * child, nil) before moving "p" into the root slot. Deleting "m" leaves
1415	 * fixNode == nil under "t": sibling "x" is BLACK with black children ->
1416	 * Case 2 (recolor "x" RED, fixNode climbs to "t"); "t"'s sibling "d" is
1417	 * also BLACK with black children -> Case 2 again (recolor "d" RED, fixNode
1418	 * climbs to the new root "p", loop exits). */
